{%- comment -%}
  The ZOREV Pair (homepage band, id "pair" for the #pair links).

  All markup, copy, state and script live in snippets/pair-offer.liquid,
  which /collections/the-pair renders too, so the two can never say
  different things. The products, price and saving come from Theme
  settings > Offers through snippets/pair-price; the saving itself is
  Shopify's automatic Buy X Get Y discount.

  The band is the page's one coloured band (.zv-forest). Its picture is one
  stone plate with the makers' own studio packshots of both products
  standing on the same floor; the oil's packshot follows the option chosen.
  A real photograph of the two products together can replace the plate
  (Photograph below) — it has to be a real photograph: no generated or
  composited scene.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
{% render 'pair-offer',
   uid: section.id,
   anchor: 'pair',
   heading_level: 2,
   body: s.body,
   photo: s.photo,
   photo_mobile: s.photo_mobile,
   video: s.video,
   photo_alt: s.photo_alt %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "The pair",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "The products, price and saving come from Theme settings > Offers, so this section, the product page, the Pair collection page and the cart always agree. The band reads the bag: it only quotes the pair price when adding one of each would really get the saving." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Extra copy" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Photograph or film (optional)" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Empty (recommended): one stone plate with the makers' studio packshots of both products (Theme settings > Studio images), and the oil's picture follows the option chosen. Only add a real photograph of GODA and HOYGI together; a generated or composited scene must not stand in for the products." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "photo", "label": "Photograph", "info": "4:3, at least 1600 × 1200 px, both products inside the central 5:4 area. Shown at most 640 px wide. Set the focal point in Content > Files." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "photo_mobile", "label": "Photograph for phones (optional)", "info": "5:4, at least 1200 × 960 px. Left empty, phones get a 5:4 crop of the photograph above." },
    { "type": "video", "id": "video", "label": "Film (optional)", "info": "4:3, 6 to 10 seconds, silent, loops cleanly. Uses the photograph as its poster." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "photo_alt", "label": "Photograph description", "info": "What is in the picture, for screen readers." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "The pair" }]
}
{% endschema %}
